      "side": 1,
      "message": "I assume you do a get_page() inside this vendor hook, otherwise there is no guarantee it is still valid after put_page() at line 2847 is called. And this opens up another possible issue that keeping the page in a cache might prevent the system from freeing it. Something to keep in mind.",
      "range": {
